1
00:00:00,700 --> 00:00:03,400
Uppför trappan – ett, två, tre

2
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:06,400
Titta ner, vad kan jag se?

3
00:00:06,400 --> 00:00:08,400
En rutschkana!

4
00:00:08,400 --> 00:00:10,400
Här ska jag åka –

5
00:00:10,400 --> 00:00:13,400
swish, swish, ner i såsen (såsen!)

6
00:00:13,400 --> 00:00:15,400
Plask, plask, plask!

7
00:00:15,400 --> 00:00:18,400
Mums, mums, mums!

8
00:00:18,400 --> 00:00:22,400
Tänk om det fanns ett brunt, brunt land

9
00:00:22,400 --> 00:00:25,400
med chokladträd och kolastrand!

10
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:27,400
Brunt, brunt, brunt –

11
00:00:27,400 --> 00:00:28,400
mums, mums, mums!

12
00:00:28,400 --> 00:00:30,400
Åka rutschkana (-kana, -kana!)

13
00:00:30,400 --> 00:00:32,700
rakt ner i kolasås –

14
00:00:32,700 --> 00:00:34,200
swish, swish, plask!

15
00:00:34,200 --> 00:00:35,700
Mums, mums, mums!

